It is pointed out that DNA report Ex.P/36, clearly makes observations as under :-
(i) No 'Y' STR DNA profile was obtained from the vaginal slide of the Victim;
(ii) The DNA profile obtained from the vaginal slide of the Victim matches with the blood sample Ex.'F' obtained from the Victim;
(iii) New born child (Ex.G) is biological son of the Victim (F);
(iv) New born child (Ex.G) is not a biological son of the accused Sanju Vadiva (Ex.B).
